{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org\/","@type":"Organization","@id":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io\/reviews\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/en","name":"Semper Fi Custom Remodeling of Asheville","logo":"https:\/\/cdn.trustindex.io\/companies\/af\/af7795399632ga46\/avatar.jpg","url":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com","description":"Do you agree with Semper Fi Custom Remodeling of Asheville&#039;s 4.9-star rating? Check out what 127 people have written and share your own experience.","brand":{"@type":"Brand","@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com","name":"Semper Fi Custom Remodeling of Asheville"},"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn.trustindex.io\/companies\/af\/af7795399632ga46\/screenshot.jpg","width":500,"height":348},"address":[{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"3038 US-70","addressLocality":"Black Mountain","postalCode":"28711","addressCountry":"US"},{"streetAddress":"355 Suite 406 Woodruff Rd","addressLocality":"Greenville","postalCode":"29607","addressCountry":"US"}],"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":4.9,"ratingCount":127},"review":[{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2026-08-17T18:29:14+00:00","reviewBody":"Semper Fi built our dream kitchen, upgraded our lighting, and installed beautiful hardwood floors! Their professionalism is unmatched. The key to our amazing experience was the weekly on-site communication with our project manager and total transparency with pricing and schedules through their online platform. After decades of doing home renovations, this was by far the best-managed project from start to finish. Highly recommend!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Barbara N"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2025-09-15T00:00:00+00:00","reviewBody":"These guys are top-notch! Especially Aron, the project manager on our kitchen renovation--he was attentive, professional, and incredibly organized. I would absolutely recommend them to anyone and wouldn't hesitate to partner with them again at the drop of a hat.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/semper-fi-custom-remodeling-black-mountain-2","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"John P"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2024-08-23T14:13:36+00:00","reviewBody":"We recently had the pleasure of working with Semper Fi Custom Remodeling on a significant home renovation project, and we are absolutely thrilled with the results. From start to finish, the team exhibited outstanding professionalism, attention to detail, and a true commitment to delivering high-quality work. While there may be companies offering remodeling services at a lower cost, our experience confirmed that \u201cyou get what you pay for,\u201d and we are so glad we chose Semper Fi. Our project included major renovations to our kitchen and master bathroom, replacing three toilets, refinishing hardwood floors on the main floor, replacing all shower heads in four bathrooms, repainting the entire interior of our home, and repairing and painting the railings on our front porch. Throughout the process, clear and consistent communication was a hallmark of the Semper Fi team. RJ, our estimator, was thorough and transparent, ensuring we fully understood the scope and cost of the project from the start. Ali, the in-house designer, brought creativity and a keen eye for detail to every decision, helping us shape spaces that are both beautiful and functional. However, it was Aaron, our project manager, who truly stood out. At several stages along the way, Aaron found ways to save us money without compromising on quality, which we greatly appreciated. His proactive approach to cost-saving measures demonstrated his dedication not only to the project\u2019s success but also to our satisfaction as clients. Aaron also made sure that our older appliances, which were still in working order, were repurposed or donated, minimizing the environmental impact of our renovation. This level of care and responsibility is rare and speaks volumes about the values that Semper Fi upholds. We also want to extend our appreciation to the full-time staff, including John, Devar, and Andrew, who provided extra attention and care throughout the project. Their dedication and hard work were evident in every aspect of the renovation, ensuring that everything was completed to the highest standards. Aaron\u2019s responsiveness and transparency, especially when we made additional requests or sought minor modifications, were nothing short of exceptional. He coordinated the various subcontractors with precision, ensuring that everyone was respectful and diligent in their work, always careful to avoid making a mess in our home. The final result is spectacular\u2014our newly renovated spaces not only look amazing but also reflect the high standard of craftsmanship that Semper Fi Custom Remodeling is known for. We are beyond satisfied with the outcome and wholeheartedly recommend them to anyone seeking a top-tier remodeling experience. Aaron, John, Devar, Andrew, and the entire team at Semper Fi exceeded our expectations at every turn, and we are incredibly grateful for the exceptional work they did on our home.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Len C"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2024-06-20T14:13:29+00:00","reviewBody":"From beginning to end our experience with Semper Fi Custom Remodeling has been outstanding! The planning stage, the prep work, the finishing touches and everything in between were all handled with professionalism, expertise and personal attention. Our project manager, Aaron, served as our guide in decision-making all along the way. We had never tackled remodeling before so his attention to detail, his extensive knowledge and his exceptional problem-solving ability gave us the confidence we needed to carry on! Aaron came up with ideas and solutions at every turn, but if he couldn't address the issue, he knew someone who could. His sub contractors were always top notch! In these difficult times for the construction business, how often do we hear about a kitchen\/bath\/crawlspace remodel project being completed (all but a few finishing touches) nearly six weeks AHEAD of schedule? Thank you Jay, Chris, R.J., Aaron and the entire Semper Fi team for making our dream come true - YOU ARE THE BEST!! Doug and Cheryl Frey After our initial kitchen and bath remodel we called on Semper Fi again to help with designing and installing a wall unit in our den. They worked with us on coming to a price that was within our budget - working with Black Mountain Cabinetry and Design. The lower cabinets and the vast bookshelves met our needs and serve as a beautiful focal point for our new den! As usual Matt and Eric were the models of professionalism. Matts carpentry and Eric's expertise and guidance provided another top notch experience! Even though it was a small project, they treated us with respect and attention to every detail. Thank you again Semper Fi family!!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Cheryl F"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2022-12-22T18:14:44+00:00","reviewBody":"We engaged Semper Fi for a near whole home renovation, including new siding, deck, kitchen, bedroom, changing the old bathroom into a laundry\/closet, changing a bedroom into a luxury bathroom, dining, and living room. Throughout the whole process the team at Semper Fi has been super responsive and professional and we are beyond happy with how our project came out. Huge shout out to our project manager Seth for being awesome! I would absolutely recommend Semper Fi to anyone looking to do a project, large or small.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Stacey L"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2021-11-10T21:32:41+00:00","reviewBody":"Semper Fi Custom Remodeling has been a wonderful choice for our remodeling project. Everyone who was involved in our project has been very professional and knowledgeable and they were very responsive to our questions and concerns. The project included gutting the entire master bathroom (walls included) and the kitchen. We were pleasantly surprised by containment of the construction debris. The workers were removing everything out of the house and sweeping at the end of each day. All items that could be reused they took to Habitat for Humanity. Brandon, our project manager, had everyone and every project under control. Should we decide to do another project you can bet we will be asking for Semper Fi help again.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Judy S"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-11-24T01:23:40+00:00","reviewBody":"My dream kitchen now exists! I love it. Very professional group. I recommend them highly!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jan M"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-11-18T13:56:03+00:00","reviewBody":"Where do I start with how pleased we were to work with Semper Fi!?!? We are new to Black Mountain and bought a mid-century \"fixer-upper\"...we interviewed and got estimates from 4 contractors and even though their estimate was in the middle pricewise, we knew that SF was the right company. Their professionalism, communication and quality standards were obvious! Chris, Jay, the entire Semper Fi team, and all of their subcontractors were easy to work with and did beautiful work! COVID arrived mid-remodel and with a few modifications, we were able to continue the work and finish nearly on time and within budget. We added a few \"small projects\" and they rearranged the project to accommodate us. We had a complete new kitchen and master bath built, as well as remodel to a few closets, a guest bedroom, new ceilings and hardwoods floors, almost every room in the house painted, a built-in \"mud-room\" style bench and shelves in entrance. They were always available to answer our questions and when a few minor things didn't go as planned, they were quick to remedy them. I would highly recommend Semper Fi--they are honest, hard-working and so easy to work with. Their quality of work and communication were far and above what I have experienced with previous contractors...and we are so grateful for them!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Marta P"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-11-01T00:00:00+00:00","reviewBody":"Where do I start with how pleased we were to work with Semper Fi!?!? We are new to Black Mountain and bought a mid-century \"fixer-upper\"...we interviewed and got estimates from 4 contractors and even though their estimate was in the middle pricewise, we knew that SF was the right company. Their professionalism, communication and quality standards were obvious! Chris, Jay, the entire Semper Fi team, and all of their subcontractors were easy to work with and did beautiful work! COVID arrived mid-remodel and with a few modifications, we were able to continue the work and finish nearly on time and within budget. We added a few \"small projects\" and they rearranged the project to accommodate us. We had a complete new kitchen and master bath built, as well as remodel to a few closets, a guest bedroom, new ceilings and hardwoods floors, almost every room in the house painted, a built-in \"mud-room\" style bench and shelves in entrance. They were always available to answer our questions and when a few minor things didn't go as planned, they were quick to remedy them. I would highly recommend Semper Fi--they are honest, hard-working and so easy to work with. Their quality of work and communication were far and above what I have experienced with previous contractors...and we are so grateful for them!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/semper-fi-custom-remodeling-black-mountain-2","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Marta P"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-08-25T22:04:10+00:00","reviewBody":"Semper Fi took care of finishing our lower level space, including framing, drywall, leveling floors and installing new flooring, installing mini kitchen\/bar, new bathroom with all plumbing, new A\/C. Their craftsmen were excellent - particularly carpenters Brent and JP. Our Project Manager Mike Owens was patient and helpful, dealing with sub-contractors, taking care of minor issues and working with unusual timelines during very unusual circumstances due to the work environment caused by the 2020 pandemic. We couldn't have completed this project without them.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sherry C"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-01-29T17:22:19+00:00","reviewBody":"We bought our dream home in Weaverville which had one major flaw: a crowded, claustrophobic, outdated kitchen and dining area. Appliances were inadequate, spaces were chopped up with walls and no one wanted to be in the kitchen. As we spoke with Jay, Ashley and Patrick our vision began to take shape for a radical remodel of that entire end of the house. The final result was beyond our wildest dreams. But such a fantastic result could only have taken place because of Semper Fi's remarkable people and process. Every phone call was returned within that day. Every email was answered quickly. When we could not make up our minds, we were provided wise counsel and multiple options to choose from. They deftly weighed the opinions of several family members on key issues. Over our months of collaborative efforts they became friends as well as expert professionals. But best of all was the final result. We love our new kitchen and dining area!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Victor P"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2019-03-14T00:00:00+00:00","reviewBody":"When the first attempt at finding a contractor for our remodeling project fell through, we weren't sure where to turn. Our designer directed us to Semper Fi Custom Remodeling and we could not be happier with the choice. They helped us achieve OUR goals, stay within budget and in the end we had the kitchen and bathroom of our dreams! Their relationships with their vendors were very amiable. There were many challenges in completing a remodel in a 90 year old house, but each was met with skill. They consulted with us regularly to make sure what they were doing was going to work within our framework and when we weren't sure what to do, their suggestions were based on past experience or research into the situation. We recommend Jay, Chris and their team to anyone looking to remodel their home.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/semper-fi-custom-remodeling-black-mountain-2","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sally B"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2019-03-05T00:00:00+00:00","reviewBody":"The staff at Semper Fi Custom Remodeling walked us through every phase of our project, from demolition, through planning, materials choices, vendors, time frames to completion. No detain was unimportant to them. We began in April, 2018 and the first part of the project was completed by September of that same year with delays mostly because of weather. Everyone pulled together in a complimentary fashion, finding excellent solutions to the on-going stream of situations that arise when renovating a 90 year old house. Budget was managed with skill and any cost-overruns were due mostly to choices we made in upgrading materials or expanding the scope of some part of the project. We were thrilled with the way the crews worked together and especially with the end result! Could not believe how smoothly the project went or how happy we were with the kitchen and bath renovation! We encourage anyone to not make a choice until they have at least talked to Chris and Jay.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.houzz.com\/professionals\/general-contractors\/semper-fi-custom-remodeling-pfvwus-pf~186428990","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sally B"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}}]}
{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/kitchens\/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/kitchens\/"},"name":"Kitchens","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do people typically want to update their kitchen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"People often update their kitchens due to a growing family needing more space, feeling confined, or simply wanting to refresh an outdated design."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do clients have control over the budget and choices?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, our remodeling company puts the \"ball in your court\" when it comes to selections, helping clients make decisions to find something they love that fits within their budget and makes them comfortable with the investment."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes kitchen remodels expensive?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The primary driver of cost in a kitchen remodel lies in the custom selections a client chooses. Major expenses include cabinets, stone countertops, and premium appliances, which can easily total $50,000 before labor. Additional costs come from lighting, backsplash, sinks, faucets, flooring patches, paint, and trim."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a kitchen remodel a good investment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, a kitchen remodel generally offers a really good return on investment (ROI), especially if you don't get \"too crazy with it\". Actions like opening up a wall for an open floor plan or adding an island can increase your ROI."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I save money on a kitchen remodel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can save money by not removing a load-bearing wall and by keeping plumbing fixtures and appliances in similar locations. Reducing the amount of tile, stone, and masonry, such as only tiling behind the range rather than all upper cabinetry, can also help."}}]}

