{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org\/","@type":"Organization","@id":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io\/reviews\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/en","name":"Semper Fi Custom Remodeling of Asheville","logo":"https:\/\/cdn.trustindex.io\/companies\/af\/af7795399632ga46\/avatar.jpg","url":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com","description":"Do you agree with Semper Fi Custom Remodeling of Asheville&#039;s 4.9-star rating? Check out what 127 people have written and share your own experience.","brand":{"@type":"Brand","@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com","name":"Semper Fi Custom Remodeling of Asheville"},"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn.trustindex.io\/companies\/af\/af7795399632ga46\/screenshot.jpg","width":500,"height":348},"address":[{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"3038 US-70","addressLocality":"Black Mountain","postalCode":"28711","addressCountry":"US"},{"streetAddress":"355 Suite 406 Woodruff Rd","addressLocality":"Greenville","postalCode":"29607","addressCountry":"US"}],"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":4.9,"ratingCount":127},"review":[{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2026-06-04T14:47:33+00:00","reviewBody":"We had foundation weakness in our unfinished basement. Semper Fi shored up the foundation, and made a wonderful space with finished windows and door. The tradesmen working on the job were extraordinary; communication and working with us on changes or developments. We are very happy we went with this company. The price was quite a bit more than we expected, but it was a much bigger and better job than we had anticipated.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Lawrence A"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2021-01-04T02:09:54+00:00","reviewBody":"We used Semper Fi to remodel 3 bathrooms in a 65 year old home. Mike was our project manager. We thought the team did an exceptional job, were professional, communicative, and responsive. Not only did they complete the job, they also came up with solutions for problems as they arose. For example, they identified a blocked underground drain which was causing a humid basement and rotting drywall. They were able to efficiently address and repair this, preventing problems down the road. It has been reassuring to see that they are able to handle unforeseen problems as well as straight forward projects.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Bob M"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-11-21T17:35:47+00:00","reviewBody":"Loved working with Semper Fi. Chris, Jay and the whole team are super professional and responsive. They remodeled my entire basement and did such a great job that I asked them to do a second job totally replacing my deck. They also did a great job of working around my schedule when needed and keeping the work area clear of debris and safe for the dog. I would keep using them but I've run out of projects!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Alexa V"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-08-25T22:04:10+00:00","reviewBody":"Semper Fi took care of finishing our lower level space, including framing, drywall, leveling floors and installing new flooring, installing mini kitchen\/bar, new bathroom with all plumbing, new A\/C. Their craftsmen were excellent - particularly carpenters Brent and JP. Our Project Manager Mike Owens was patient and helpful, dealing with sub-contractors, taking care of minor issues and working with unusual timelines during very unusual circumstances due to the work environment caused by the 2020 pandemic. We couldn't have completed this project without them.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sherry C"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2019-12-18T00:00:00+00:00","reviewBody":"I recently worked with SemperFi to renovate my basement, including moving walls, adding windows, replacing exterior doors, and installing a wet bar, new floors, ceilings and lighting. The team at SemperFi is easy to work with, uber professional and highly skilled. They paid careful attention down to the last detail and were excellent at communicating when decisions needed to be made, questions arose, etc. They worked around my schedule. And importantly for me, they kept the work space secure and tidy so my dog could safely and freely romp in the adjacent yard while they were working. I highly recommend SemperFi and plan to work with them again on future projects.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/semper-fi-custom-remodeling-black-mountain-2","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Alexa V"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}}]}
{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/basement-finishing\/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/basement-finishing\/"},"name":"Basement Finishing","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Do all basement remodeling projects require permits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many basement remodeling and finishing projects do require permits, especially when electrical, plumbing, or structural changes are involved. Permit requirements vary based on scope, so it\u2019s important to understand what applies to your specific project before construction begins."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a basement with low ceilings still be remodeled?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In many cases, yes. Ceiling height and structural conditions influence design decisions, but they don\u2019t automatically prevent basement renovations. Understanding these constraints early helps guide layout, lighting, and finishing options that work within the space."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What affects the cost of a basement remodel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The cost of basement remodeling depends on several factors, including the size of the space, existing conditions, mechanical requirements, and the overall scope of work. Finishing an unfinished basement and renovating an older finished basement can involve very different levels of complexity."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can bathrooms or additional rooms be added during basement finishing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Basement finishing can include adding bathrooms or additional rooms when the space and existing systems allow. These additions typically involve coordination between plumbing, electrical, and layout planning as part of the overall renovation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a basement remodeling project usually take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Basement remodeling timelines vary based on scope, complexity, and project details. Rather than focusing on a fixed timeline, it\u2019s more important to plan the project thoroughly so construction can move forward efficiently once work begins."}}]}

