this company! The two owners Jay and Chris have bent over backwards to give me what I wanted, even edited their quote a couple of times so I ended up with everything I could have wished for. This is the second time they have worked at my home. They completed an extensive renovation a couple of years ago when they repaired some damage to my flooring system and exterior walls. This year a tree fell onto my roof so they are giving me a new roof and decking. They are courteous, on time, and professional. I am already planning my next project - an addition at the end of my house. I love giving my business to these two patriotic young Marines!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Annette E"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2019-02-14T03:51:18+00:00","reviewBody":"We have used Semper Fi for multiple remodel projects over the past couple of years, including creatively adding a bathroom to a small home and working with a home designer to expand a mountain cabin crawlspace to additional livable space. Semper Fi sets realistic tie and cost expectations, they kept us informed every step of the way. They met every deadline and didn't increase the price because they did a great job of estimating upfront costs. I highly recommend!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Kenny C"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}}]}
{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/home-additions\/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/home-additions\/"},"name":"Home Additions","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do homeowners decide to build a home addition?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most homeowners choose an addition because they need more space without wanting to move. Common reasons include a growing family, working from home, adding a primary suite, or making the home more comfortable long\u2011term in a neighborhood they already like."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is adding a room better than buying a bigger house?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It can be. A home addition allows you to stay in your current location while customizing the space around how you actually live. For many homeowners, this feels more practical than moving and compromising on layout, location, or features."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What factors affect the cost of a home addition?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cost is most influenced by the size of the addition and the types of spaces being added. Rooms that require plumbing or more structural work typically cost more, while simpler expansions tend to be more straightforward. Finish selections also play a major role in the overall investment."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a home addition a good investment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A well\u2011planned home addition can add long\u2011term value, especially when it improves functionality or adds usable square footage. The best returns usually come from additions that feel like a natural extension of the home rather than an afterthought."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we live in our home during a home addition project?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In many cases, yes. We strive to offer a client-first experience and keep your comfort as a priority. It often depends on where the addition is located and how much of the existing home is affected. Some homeowners stay in the house with minor adjustments, while others prefer to relocate temporarily for comfort."}}]}

