ixing. Easy going and trustworthy to have around your house. They are up front and honest about how they like to do things.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Crystal S"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-08-25T00:40:01+00:00","reviewBody":"Jay and Chris are great people to work with. Their team did an outstanding job in transforming our bathroom to a aging in place bathroom. We are well pleased and highly recommend Semper Fi.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/search\/?api=1&query=Google&query_place_id=ChIJabFoX9P5WYgRe1OqgemWV3Y","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Linda H"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2020-05-19T00:00:00+00:00","reviewBody":"We feel like fans and \"family\" with the Semper Fi group. Our remodeling project spanned 5 months, so frequent messaging, meetings, and day to day detailing helped form a most pleasant association all the way through. The quality of their workmanship is outstanding. We have complete confidence in Jay and Chris and are thrilled to live in an amazing home they transformed for us.","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.houzz.com\/professionals\/general-contractors\/semper-fi-custom-remodeling-pfvwus-pf~186428990","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Fred B"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2018-11-05T00:00:00+00:00","reviewBody":"Great business and great customer service!! James Cope and crew went out of their way to provide an out of state estimate for a request to build a highly technical attached deck with electrical wiring. James was quick to reply and thorough on all estimate expenses. I appreciate their honesty and integrity about the project! Thank you for serving our country and thank you for the deck estimate! Semper Fidelis!","inLanguage":"en","url":"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/semper-fi-custom-remodeling-black-mountain-2","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Terry M"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","worstRating":1,"bestRating":5,"ratingValue":5},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trustindex","sameAs":"https:\/\/www.trustindex.io"}}]}
{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/aging-in-place\/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/sfcustomremodeling.com\/aging-in-place\/"},"name":"CAPS (Certified Aging-In-Place)","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is aging-in-place remodeling (and how is it different from a standard remodel)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Aging\u2011in\u2011place remodeling uses universal design strategies to make your home safer, easier to navigate, and more comfortable as your needs change.\nUnlike a style\u2011only remodel, it prioritizes features like safer entries, wider clearances, improved lighting, and kitchen and bathroom layouts that reduce fall risk\u2014while still keeping your home functional and beautiful.\nAt Semper Fi, we strive to create safe and independent living environments for those planning ahead or responding to a current need."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What aging-in-place home modifications make the biggest difference?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The most impactful aging\u2011in\u2011place home modifications focus on areas where daily routines and safety matter most\u2014including entries, bathrooms, kitchens, and main pathways.\nCommon solutions include ramps, widened doorways, grab bars, walk\u2011in bathing options, lower countertops, improved lighting, built\u2011in shower seating, non\u2011slip flooring, and lever\u2011style handles to reduce strain and trip hazards."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why hire a Certified Aging\u2011in\u2011Place Specialist (CAPS)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Working with a Certified Aging\u2011in\u2011Place Specialist near you means your remodel is guided by formal training through the National Association of Home Builders. At Semper Fi, our CAPS\u2011certified team designs spaces that balance safety, function, and long\u2011term livability\u2014without sacrificing style."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you approach aging\u2011in\u2011place remodeling projects?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our aging\u2011in\u2011place remodeling process starts with understanding how you live in your home today and how that may change over time.\nFrom there, we develop a custom plan that improves safety, accessibility, and flow\u2014without sacrificing comfort or style."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we live in the home during aging\u2011in\u2011place remodeling?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Often yes, but it depends on the scope\u2014especially for kitchen and bathroom remodels, which can be more disruptive.\nWe discuss logistics early, including noise, access, and daily routines, so you know what to expect and can plan accordingly."}}]}

